G","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/EsqlQueryRequest.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/EsqlQueryRequest.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":6665,"endPos":7781,"startLine":223,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":247,"endLineOffset":5,"length":1117}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/EsqlQueryRequest.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/EsqlQueryRequest.java--7787:7866","promptId":"#2X8TC","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/EsqlQueryRequest.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/action/EsqlQueryRequest.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":7787,"endPos":7866,"startLine":249,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":251,"endLineOffset":5,"length":80}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/ExpressionBuilder.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/ExpressionBuilder.java--10456:10640","promptId":"#1J218","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/ExpressionBuilder.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/parser/ExpressionBuilder.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":10456,"endPos":10640,"startLine":228,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":231,"endLineOffset":5,"length":185}]}]},{"comment":"The `tables` method in `EsqlConfiguration` provides access to the tables map. Ensure that the returned map is immutable to prevent external modifications. Consider using `Collections.unmodifiableMap(tables)` to achieve this.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/session/EsqlConfiguration.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/session/EsqlConfiguration.java--4904:5039","promptId":"#2GNSE","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/m